# システム環境設定's 〈電源管理〉 as 利用者 (design 3.8, 3.9, 8.7.1, 11), for tools/ui_run.py:
# the limit of the processors' clock and the watchdog are written to the machine's
# settings with no question for the administrator's password, and the kernel takes them
# at once. The window is at 160,80: the tab 電源管理 at 282,151; プロセッサの上限 1800MHz
# at 420,453 and 最大 at 583,453; ウォッチドッグ's switch at 390,548, its seconds at
# 465,548, and 設定 at 708,548. QEMU has no firmware: the clock is unknown and only the
# limit shows. Ctrl+E closes.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
expect sysenv: settings CPU_MHZ 1800 WATCHDOG 30
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 282 151
wait 500
expect sysenv: clock （不明）　上限 1800MHz
shot se_power
# the most, and a minute
click 583 453
click 465 548
key 2a
key 2a
key 2a
text 60
wait 300
click 708 548
expect sysenv: performance CPU_MHZ 0 WATCHDOG 60 (0)
expect cpu: limit 0 MHz (the most)
expect watchdog on: reset 60 s
expect sysenv: clock （不明）　上限 最大
shot se_most
# opened again: as kept
key 08 01
expect sysenv: closed
# its pages filled (the faces read take a while) before anything is pressed
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expectsince sysenv: ready
expect sysenv: settings CPU_MHZ 0 WATCHDOG 60
wait 800
click 282 151
wait 500
shot se_again
# the watchdog off: its seconds can no longer be worked
click 390 548
wait 300
click 708 548
expect sysenv: performance CPU_MHZ 0 WATCHDOG 0 (0)
expect watchdog off
shot se_wdoff
# back as the machine came: 1800MHz, 30 seconds
click 420 453
click 390 548
wait 300
click 465 548
key 2a
key 2a
key 2a
text 30
wait 300
click 708 548
expect sysenv: performance CPU_MHZ 1800 WATCHDOG 30 (0)
expect cpu: limit 1800 MHz
expect watchdog on: reset 30 s
wait 1000
shot se_back
key 08 01
wait 500
absent !OACV!
